---
layout: layouts/base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: Services | {{ metadata.title }}
description: Brand and web systems for businesses that have outgrown their current brand. Custom branding, websites, and content—tailored to where your business is going.
---

<div class="barba-container loading" data-barba="container" data-barba-namespace="services">
    <main>
        <section id="banner">
            <div class="section__wrapper">
                <h1 class="lg headline__load">Everything your brand needs, under one roof</h1>
                <div class="st__plax --banner">
                    <img
                        srcset="/assets/services/services-banner.webp, /assets/services/services-banner@1080.webp 1080w"
                        src="/assets/services/services-banner.webp"
                        sizes="100vw"
                        alt="Duo Studio team collaborating at a desk with laptop and notebook"
                        class="st__plax--inner"
                        width="1920"
                        height="1184"/>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section id="services">
            <div class="section__wrapper">
                <h2 class="st__text">
                    <span>Our Expertise</span>A Baltimore design studio with a relentless passion for crafting personalized solutions
                </h2>
                <div class="row plax__cols">
                    <a class="col cursor__hover --highlight" href="/services/branding-identity-system/">
                        <h2>Branding</h2>
                        <div class="no-overflow">
                            <div class="st__plax">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__branding-thumbnail.webp 500w"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__branding-thumbnail.webp"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 26vw, 88vw"
                                    alt="Brand identity work by Duo Studio showing Finturity business cards"
                                    class="st__plax--inner"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="500"
                                    height="640"/>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="subtitle">
                            We translate the values of your company into a brand that speaks to your audience and outshines your competitors. We
                            start off with a strong brand strategy and finish with an all-encompassing identity system that includes a logo design,
                            messaging, and brand guidelines.
                        </p>
                        <div class="btn__small">Learn More</div>
                    </a>
                    <a class="col cursor__hover --highlight" href="/services/web-design-development/">
                        <h2>Websites</h2>
                        <div class="no-overflow">
                            <div class="st__plax">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__website-thumbnail.webp 500w"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__website-thumbnail.webp"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 26vw, 88vw"
                                    alt="Website design example showing MadeGood mobile site on a smartphone"
                                    class="st__plax--inner"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="500"
                                    height="640"/>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="subtitle">
                            Websites serve as the gateway to your company, and first impressions matter. From interactive portfolios to e-commerce
                            marketplaces, we combine unique web design and custom web development tailor-made for you and your users.
                        </p>
                        <div class="btn__small">Learn More</div>
                    </a>
                    <a class="col cursor__hover --highlight" href="/services/graphic-design/">
                        <h2>Content</h2>
                        <div class="no-overflow">
                            <div class="st__plax">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__content-thumbnail.webp 500w"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__content-thumbnail.webp"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 26vw, 88vw"
                                    alt="Content design example showing fm. brand billboard campaign"
                                    class="st__plax--inner"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="500"
                                    height="640"/>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="subtitle">
                            There’s no limit to how you market your company and what your brand can do. With our art direction and team’s diverse
                            skills, see your company's vision come alive through print and digital graphic design, illustration, and motion
                            graphics.
                        </p>
                        <div class="btn__small">Learn More</div>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section id="process" class="bg__trigger--custom">
                <div class="process-section">
                    <header class="process-header">
                        <div class="title st__headline">Inside the Process</div>
                        <a href="/contact/" class="btn__circle">
                            <p>Start a Project</p>
                        </a>
                    </header>
                    <div class="process-list">
                        <div class="process-item">
                            <div class="process-index"><span>001</span> / 005</div>
                            <div class="process-content">
                                <h2 class="title-2">Discovery</h2>
                                <p>Every project starts with understanding what matters most. Through collaborative workshops, we learn about your audience, goals, and market to uncover the insight that will shape the work.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="process-image">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__branding@625.webp 625w"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 100vw"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__branding@625.webp"
                                    alt="Brand identity design exploration"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="625"
                                    height="465" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="process-item">
                            <div class="process-index"><span>002</span> / 005</div>
                            <div class="process-content">
                                <h2 class="title-2">Strategy</h2>
                                <p>With the right insight in place, strategy gives the work direction. We shape your positioning, clarify how your brand should be understood, and create a framework to guide the creative process.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="process-image">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__websites@625.webp 625w"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 100vw"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__websites@625.webp"
                                    alt="Strategy and wireframe planning"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="625"
                                    height="465" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="process-item">
                            <div class="process-index"><span>003</span> / 005</div>
                            <div class="process-content">
                                <h2 class="title-2">Execution</h2>
                                <p>This is where the work comes to life. We translate strategy into a brand experience that feels cohesive across every touchpoint, from identity and design to websites, content, and creative systems.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="process-image">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__content@625.webp 625w"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 100vw"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__content@625.webp"
                                    alt="Design execution and development"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="625"
                                    height="465" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="process-item">
                            <div class="process-index"><span>004</span> / 005</div>
                            <div class="process-content">
                                <h2 class="title-2">Hand-Off</h2>
                                <p>When the work is complete, we make sure the transition feels smooth. Along with files and documentation, we lead a handoff meeting to walk through the final product and answer questions so your team feels ready to manage it with confidence.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="process-image">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__branding-thumbnail.webp 500w"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 100vw"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__branding-thumbnail.webp"
                                    alt="Project handoff and documentation"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="500"
                                    height="640" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="process-item">
                            <div class="process-index"><span>005</span> / 005</div>
                            <div class="process-content">
                                <h2 class="title-2">Support</h2>
                                <p>We build for the long term. After launch, every client has a 30-day support window for final refinements and post-launch needs. Beyond that, we can put the right support plan in place as the work continues to grow with your brand.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="process-image">
                                <img
                                    srcset="/assets/services/services__content-thumbnail.webp 500w"
                                    sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30vw, 100vw"
                                    src="/assets/services/services__content-thumbnail.webp"
                                    alt="Ongoing brand support and collaboration"
                                    loading="lazy"
                                    width="500"
                                    height="640" />
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="why" class="cursor__hover" data-attribute-text="Switch">
                <div class="section__wrapper">
                    <div class="row">
                        <div class="col">
                            <video
                                src="/assets/services/services__our-specialty.mp4"
                                autoplay="autoplay"
                                loop="loop"
                                muted="muted"
                                playsinline="playsinline"
                                class="mask"></video>
                            <div class="title st__headline">Our specialty</div>
                            <p class="st__text">We see each project as an opportunity to discover new limits in what’s possible. With our clients as
                                our collaborative partners, our mission is to create eye-catching designs that make an immediate impact, while leaving a
                                lasting imprint for the future.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col">
                            <video
                                src="/assets/services/services__your-growth.mp4"
                                autoplay="autoplay"
                                loop="loop"
                                muted="muted"
                                playsinline="playsinline"
                                class="mask"></video>
                            <div class="title st__headline">Your growth</div>
                            <p class="st__text">We never stop looking ahead. As your go-to digital design studio, we work with you to overcome real-world challenges in a changing climate. From logo designs to digital marketing campaigns, we implement
                                multiple strategies that stimulate growth.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section id="testimonial">
                <div class="section__wrapper">
                    <div class="content">
                        <h2 class="st__text">"Duo has a creative output that can rival any major design studio"</h2>
                        <p class="st__text">“I’ve worked with Duo Studio on multiple projects. They delivered best in class designs and
                            development capabilities each and every time! Sonia, Dat, and the entire team at Duo never ceases to amaze me and my
                            partners with their down-to-earth attitude, reliability, and quality of work. To top that off, Duo has a creative output
                            that can rival any major design studio, with an added bonus of personalized attention and lightning-fast communication.
                            I highly recommend Duo Studio as a strategic partner for your next design project."</p>
                        <p class="subtitle st__text">MGNY Consulting<br>Yuri Geylik</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
                {% include "layouts/footer.njk" %}
            </div>
        </main>
    </div>
</div>